From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] kernelbase, conhost: console aliases (3739)

kernelbase, conhost: console aliases

AddConsoleAlias, GetConsoleAlias, GetConsoleAliases(Length), GetConsoleAliasExes
(Length), A and W, are served by a per-console alias table in conhost (new
condrv ioctls 26..29). The A forms use the console code page.
---
